  "description": "The BACKROAD+ GRX RX810 Di2 delivers high-end gravel performance. The modern frame design of this ROSE e-bike platform integrates the battery, motor and cables. Powerful from the first step – in the city, in the country and in the mountains. The BACKROAD+ has everything you expect from a modern, high-end gravel bike for the next generation. This e-gravel bike is equipped with a high-quality Ritchey WCS Venture Max carbon dropbar and a clean ROSE Square stem, as well as a high-end Shimano SC-EM800 colour display. Enjoy full control and easy handling on any terrain through intuitive control of the Shimano EP8’s three support modes via the STI switches of the Shimano GRX RX810 Di2. MORE ABOUT Shimano SC-EM800 Display • Compact and flat design • Selected profile and support modes on EM800 display / modes customisable by rider via E-TUBE • Detachable power cable (SD300 type) • Updated wireless communication / E-TUBE PROJECT wireless communication via smartphone or tablet / ANT private wireless communication with third-party cycling computers • Compatible with the new thinner EW-SD300 cables The form-fit integrated Shimano EP8 motor delivers a maximum torque of 85 Nm at a weight of just 2.6 kg. Adjustable power allows you, the rider, to enjoy sensitive control and maximum flexibility. Thanks to minimal pedalling resistance, the result is a particularly natural and harmonious riding experience. MORE ABOUT Shimano EP8 Motor • Two individual rider profiles can be created – whether for your daily commute to work or a weekend in the countryside • Choice of three different modes Eco, Trail, & Boost. Each mode offers you ten different levels with different performance parameters, which means that the modes can be individually adapted to your personal rider profile and the conditions of your tour • Five setting options for launch support • Maximum torque can be selected (from 20 Nm up to max. 85 Nm) / The torque assistance being provided depends on the strength of your pedal pressure MORE ABOUT E-TUBE Project App You can adjust the power of the Shimano EP8 motor to your individual preferences via an app on your smartphone. You are special and every ride is unique. The app helps you find your personal settings for the commute to work or the next trail adventure. ¹ approx. 14.3 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for matt-black/piano-black/pure-white frame, size L, without pedals *Slight paint variances are possible at the fork.",
